              "saturation mutagenesis",
              "Pf622 binding pocket",
              "cpGFP linker",
              "directed evolution"
            ],
            "displayClaim": "Targeted saturation mutagenesis of the Pf622 binding pocket and cpGFP linkers can yield a substantially improved successor to iGABASnFR1 — the v1 ceiling is set by suboptimal residues, not the scaffold.",
            "shortClaim": "Saturation mutagenesis of Pf622 and cpGFP linkers yields a substantially improved GABA sensor."
          }
        },
